Design kit notes
================

The game's UI is a port of HabCrab's sidebar design system (~/projects/habcrab.com,
GPL-3.0) so both products look uniform.

Fonts
-----
public/webfonts/Ubuntu*.ttf are from the Ubuntu Font Package and are licensed
under the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0 (a free, redistributable licence that permits
embedding and redistribution with the licence text). Keep the licence text with
any distribution of these files: https://ubuntu.com/legal/font-licence

All other assets in this repository are original work. In-game sound effects and
music are synthesised at runtime and use no sample files.
